:{"editor":"<p>Una piattaforma industriale integrata</p><span class=\"iah-tl-hint\">Passa il mouse per approfondire</span>","text_color":"#3D5A6C","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"500","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16.5},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.45}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"c000026","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_direction_mobile":"column","content_width":"full","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#1A4D6A","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"4","right":"4","bottom":"4","left":"4","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"iah-tl-mark"},"elements":[]},{"id":"c000028","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_direction_mobile":"column","content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"iah-tl-pop"},"elements":[{"id":"w000027","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Il modello di sviluppo del Gruppo si fonda su due direttrici complementari: la crescita organica, attraverso l’integrazione delle competenze interne e l’innovazione tecnologica di processo, e la crescita per linee esterne, mediante operazioni di M&amp;A finalizzate a completare la catena del valore lungo l’intero ciclo dell’acqua industriale. L’obiettivo strategico è l’evoluzione da un insieme di società altamente specializzate a una piattaforma industriale integrata, in grado di presidiare per il cliente ogni fase del ciclo: progettazione, realizzazione, revamping, riutilizzo delle acque e delle materie valorizzabili, gestione operativa, telegestione con modelli predittivi per l’ottimizzazione dei parametri ESG e dell’impronta idrica, manutenzione programmata e straordinaria, monitoraggio periodico delle performance impiantistiche, nonché supporto nell’individuazione di strumenti di finanza agevolata a sostegno degli investimenti del cliente.</p>","text_color":"#3D5A6C","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15.5},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.65}},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"w000031","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<style>\n.iah-tl-row{position:relative;}\n.iah-tl-row::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4AB7D5,#1A4D6A);transform:translateY(-1px);z-index:0;}\n.iah-tl-row > .iah-tl-pt{flex:1 1 0!important;width:auto!important;}\n.iah-tl-pt{position:relative;height:400px;display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;}\n.iah-tl-mark{position:relative;z-index:3;width:22px!important;height:22px!important;min-width:22px;flex:0 0 22px!important;transition:transform .3s ease;}\n.iah-tl-pt:hover .iah-tl-mark{transform:scale(1.3);}\n.iah-tl-pt::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;width:2px;height:36px;background:#B7C3CB;transform:translateX(-1px);z-index:1;}\n.iah-tl-up::after{bottom:calc(50% + 11px);}\n.iah-tl-down::after{top:calc(50% + 11px);}\n.iah-tl-lbl{position:absolute!important;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:240px!important;max-width:240px;}\n.iah-tl-up .iah-tl-lbl{bottom:calc(50% + 50px);}\n.iah-tl-down .iah-tl-lbl{top:calc(50% + 50px);}\n.iah-tl-hint{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font:600 13px/1.4 Montserrat,sans-serif;color:#4AB7D5;letter-spacing:.04em;}\n.iah-tl-pop{position:absolute!important;left:50%;width:400px!important;max-width:400px;z-index:30;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translate(-50%,10px);transition:opacity .3s ease,transform .3s ease,visibility .3s;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 26px!important;box-shadow:0 26px 60px -18px rgba(13,43,62,.38);}\n.iah-tl-up .iah-tl-pop{top:calc(50% + 28px);}\n.iah-tl-down .iah-tl-pop{bottom:calc(50% + 28px);}\n.iah-tl-pt:hover .iah-tl-pop{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translate(-50%,0);}\n.iah-tl-row > .iah-tl-pt:first-child .iah-tl-pop{left:0;transform:translate(0,10px);}\n.iah-tl-row > .iah-tl-pt:first-child:hover .iah-tl-pop{transform:translate(0,0);}\n.iah-tl-row > .iah-tl-pt:last-child .iah-tl-pop{left:auto;right:0;transform:translate(0,10px);}\n.iah-tl-row > .iah-tl-pt:last-child:hover .iah-tl-pop{transform:translate(0,0);}\n.iah-tl-pop p{margin:0;}\n@media(max-width:900px){\n.iah-tl-row{flex-direction:column!important;gap:34px!important;padding-left:34px!important;}\n.iah-tl-row::before{left:10px;right:auto;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:2px;height:auto;transform:none;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#4AB7D5,#1A4D6A);}\n.iah-tl-pt{height:auto;flex-direction:column!important;align-items:flex-start!important;justify-content:flex-start!important;}\n.iah-tl-pt::after,.iah-tl-hint{display:none;}\n.iah-tl-mark{position:absolute!important;left:-34px;top:4px;}\n.iah-tl-lbl,.iah-tl-pop{position:static!important;transform:none!important;width:100%!important;max-width:none!important;opacity:1!important;visibility:visible!important;}\n.iah-tl-lbl{text-align:left!important;}\n.iah-tl-lbl .elementor-widget-container{text-align:left!important;}\n.iah-tl-pop{box-shadow:none;background:transparent;padding:8px 0 0!important;}\n}\n</style>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"r000068","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"boxed","flex_direction":"row","flex_direction_mobile":"column","boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":1000},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"24","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"center","flex_justify_content":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"r000069","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","elements":[],"settings":{"text":"Scopri le soc